hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2916","###
 Narrated to us Abu Musa, who said: Narrated to us Mu'adh ibn Hisham, who said: My father narrated to me, from Yahya ibn Abi Kathir, who said: Ba'jah ibn Abdullah ibn Badr al-Juhani narrated to me, from 'Uqbah ibn Amir al-Juhani, who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) distributed sacrificial animals among his Companions. 'Uqbah said: A one-year-old sheep (Jaza'ah"
